dbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 source-statement-proof-pending；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}posner\\text{-}robinson}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\\n[\\mathbf b&#39;=\\mathbf0&#39;\\land\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b=\\mathbf0&#39;].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}posner\\text{-}robinson}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\\n[\\mathbf b&#39;=\\mathbf0&#39;\\land\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b=\\mathbf0&#39;].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按原论文摘要核实此范围内的 low cupper 结论。原稿另式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G\\oplus A)&#39;\\equiv_TG&#39;\">\\((G\\oplus A)&#39;\\equiv_TG&#39;\\)</span> 若不关联同一 cupping 见证，可任取 G=A 使其成立，不能表达该定理；若要求 cupping 见证同时满足，则与跳跃严格性冲突，已移除。书外构造证明待补。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/journal-of-symbolic-logic/article/abs/degrees-joining-to-0/388A890D18015BD18D36DD0059707AF9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Posner–Robinson, Degrees joining to 0′, JSL 46(4), 714–722 (1981), DOI 10.2307/2273221</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf0<\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}posner\\text{-}robinson}\\vda